{"id":"7774dfe23c403fa3","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-essvarchar.md","title":"Essential-variable characterization","display":"thm-essvarchar — Essential-variable characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-essvarchar","aliases":["27-thm-essvarchar"],"display":"thm-essvarchar — Essential-variable characterization","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-essvar]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-essvarchar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-essvarchar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-essvarchar — Essential-variable characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888932bbbe1a9581\" href=\"?note=888932bbbe1a9581\" title=\"27-df-essvar\">27-df-essvar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> (Boolean function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\)</span> (essential-coordinate set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"888932bbbe1a9581\" href=\"?note=888932bbbe1a9581\" title=\"27-df-essvar\">27-df-essvar</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a> 及其上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\bigl(i\\in\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\;(x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\lor\\bar x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\bigl(i\\in\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\;(x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\lor\\bar x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A literal on an inessential coordinate could be deleted, contradicting primeness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-essvar","status":"resolved","id":"888